1. SDG theme
  a. SDG 13 - climate action
  b. SDG 7 - affordable and clean energy?
  c. SDG 2 - zero hunger?
  d. Focus on SDG 13 to teach people how farmers are affected by climate change, but implement some other things
2. Outline player mechanics
  a. Plant crops
  b. Sell crops
  c. Buy
    i. Seeds
    ii. Tools
  d. Build structures
  e. Move (WASD)
3. Gameplay 
  a. Start with some land and some money, and earn enough money to buy land in a different “level” or part of the island
  b. Levels / biomes
    i. Drought
    ii. Floods
    iii. Heat
    iv. Cold
    v. Each biome has its own “solution” or how to work around it
      1. Plants that can survive in those harsh environments
      2. Structures you can build
  c. Random generating
    i. I want to make each time you play unique without affecting the gameplay too much
